@title 3D view: a part picked in the Cabinet is framed when the 3D view opens
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768
# Pick a device in the Cabinet, then open 3D: the camera glides to frame it (220 ms, an instant move with Reduce motion). The harness shows still pictures, so the pictures are the end state: the first is the Cabinet with the device picked, the second the 3D view framing it. Compare with 3D opened without a pick, which shows the whole cabinet.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
mouse_down 628 397
mouse_up 628 397
wait 15
shot cabinet-picked
click_text 3D #1
wait 40
shot three-d-framed
check_layout
